{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059137/block/singleImage/3242302/df/01M59B400QFF4VJV521VMC4GDX.jpg?updatedAt=1792404488\"/><figcaption>油麻地一間便利店遇獨行賊行劫。(電視截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>油麻地佐敦道9號一間便利店，今日凌晨4時許突然有一名男子手持磚頭闖入並威嚇女店員。他在劫去收銀機內約6,000元現金及一包價值約90元的香煙後，向加士居道方向逃去。 警員接報到場，經初步調查將案件列作行劫。約一個半小時後，涉案42歲羅姓賊人自行乘的士到大嶼山北警署自首，他現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:04.065025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:46:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:41.105348+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:50.738571+00:00","content_hash":"d52697499c87aec83999ccb4e56bf07b50a54382307686f2219bc84f19c4ebbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}